    "updated_at": "2021-12-13T15:09:52Z",
    "body": "An alternative to exporting those definitions (since we don't *really* want other specs calling them) is to use the \"override\" syntax, `<a spec=WEBSOCKETS>obtain a WebSocket connection</a>`, which ignores exported or not-exported.\r\n\r\nAlso I think this is using `<span>` whereas `<a>` is more idiomatic.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
